  "post_content": "<p>Cuentacuentos y la llegada de Pap&aacute; Noel al Teatro M&oacute;naco, tras recorrer en una calesa las calles m&aacute;s c&eacute;ntricas precedido por la Colla Dol&ccedil;ainers Onda, y el tradicional concierto de villancicos del coro de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia a las puertas del Ayuntamiento&nbsp;han sido los ingredientes festivos de la tarde de Nochebuena.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vespranadalonda/img_2231.jpg\" alt=\"img_2231\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vespranadalonda/img_2232.jpg\" alt=\"img_2232\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vespranadalonda/img_2234.jpg\" alt=\"img_2234\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vespranadalonda/img_2235.jpg\" alt=\"img_2235\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vespranadalonda/img_2238.jpg\" alt=\"img_2238\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vespranadalonda/img_2239.jpg\" alt=\"img_2239\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vespranadalonda/img_2240.jpg\" alt=\"img_2240\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vespranadalonda/img_2241.jpg\" alt=\"img_2241\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vespranadalonda/img_2242.jpg\" alt=\"img_2242\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vespranadalonda/img_2243.jpg\" alt=\"img_2243\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img